  "note": "Re-recorded for the B-3..B-6 coverage session. The four missing artifacts now exist: a real skinned character (12-bone procedural rig, 2-bone linear blend) in `moving`, a display-resolution HUD composed after tonemap with an in-world GUI at render extent, HDR emissive with a scene-target radiance probe (peak 15.21 at the authored 16x scale), and a thin-slab screen-space refraction for the glass. Recapturing exposed a content-pipeline defect: normal/roughness/metalness/ao were encoded with `-srgbi`, linearising data (0.5 -> 0.214) and giving every normal a ~54 degree tilt. `content/tools/pins.json` was corrected, all seven packages rebuilt, and every frame recaptured, so these images supersede the B1/B2-session set. The VRAM peak remains unmeasured; Q4 is not green.",
